menu "User button"

    config USER_BUTTON_GPIO
        int "Button GPIO"
        default 9
        range 0 30
        help
            GPIO9 is the BOOT button on the ESP32-C6-DevKit. It is a strapping
            pin (held low at reset it selects download mode), which is exactly
            why it is a good choice: the same button flashes the chip and
            drives pairing, and it is wired with a pull-up already.

    config USER_BUTTON_ACTIVE_LOW
        bool "Button pulls the pin low when pressed"
        default y

    config USER_BUTTON_PAIRING_HOLD_MS
        int "Hold time to enter pairing mode (ms)"
        default 3000
        range 1000 30000

    config USER_BUTTON_RESET_HOLD_MS
        int "Hold time for a factory reset (ms)"
        default 10000
        range 2000 60000
        help
            Must be longer than the pairing hold time.

endmenu
